e, communication, or just your ability to shoot a bow accurately - usually accompanied by unique mechanic, like non-stop running through obstacles, tower defence, sailing a ship or even rhythm game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and yet it would be much easier if the Wizard hadn't left you with one cursed arrow and took away your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/2d632f6503501bb7127d426ebce0ceb8.avif?t=1779982991\" width=591 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/7cc48e74718834ab7ebb75d7e015da6c.avif?t=1779982991\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras_big/7cc48e74718834ab7ebb75d7e015da6c.webp?t=1779982991 width=1560 height=614 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 DIFFERENTLY THEMED LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/80bd135761e992da7a0b794f8dadac74.avif?t=1779982991\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras_big/80bd135761e992da7a0b794f8dadac74.avif?t=1779982991 width=1560 height=614 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 secret levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 unique soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against Wizards minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic puzzles to think but not to stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph